OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening. It will become
OL,7,Flargely cloudy overnight with some
OL,8,Fshowery outbreaks of rain, these
OL,9,Fturning heavy at times. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FIt will be cloudy again with
OL,12,Fperhaps some haar at times. Further
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy showers through the
OL,14,Fday, merging to longer spells of rain
OL,15,Fin the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,18,FChangeable with variable amounts of
OL,19,Fcloud, sunny spells and a few showers.
OL,20,FTemperatures back to near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
